Z||000004||Butter||12-11-2001||12:10 PM||||Hear's a couple my bother once pulled when the local police in town wanted to harrass him many years back and before caller ID's.<P>1. While setting at the bar observing the police observing him, he goes to the phone and calls in a disturbance across town.  Police tears out from there stake out, brother goes home.<P>2. While setting at the bar observing the police observing him, my brother calls up his wife to come and get his car and leave hers.  After she leaves and the cops follow her, my bother leaves.  While going out of the city limits he blows his horn and waves at the cops that had his wife pulled over.<P>Real Bubba Adventures! <P>||||reg||12
